  "description": "Cross200 21-Speed Comfort Hybrid Bike\n\nThe Cross200 21-Speed Comfort Hybrid Bike is designed for commuting, fitness riding, and everyday recreation. Its lightweight aluminum frame, upright riding position, and reliable Shimano drivetrain make it a practical choice for paved roads, bike paths, and light gravel trails.\n\nShimano 21-Speed Drivetrain\nA Shimano 21-speed drivetrain provides a wide gear range for city streets, moderate hills, and longer recreational rides. Smooth, dependable shifting helps riders maintain a comfortable cadence across changing terrain.\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame\nThe lightweight aluminum frame offers responsive handling while resisting rust. Relaxed frame geometry promotes an upright riding position that helps reduce fatigue during longer rides.\n\nFront Suspension Fork\nThe suspension fork helps absorb bumps, expansion joints, and uneven pavement, providing a smoother ride for commuting and recreational cycling.\n\nReliable Tektro V-Brakes\nFront and rear Tektro V-brakes deliver predictable stopping performance for everyday riding on paved roads, bike paths, and multi-use trails.\n\n700C Wheels for Efficient Riding\n700C wheels roll efficiently on pavement while remaining capable on packed gravel and recreational paths. Double-wall alloy rims add strength and durability for daily riding.\n\nRider Comfort\nA comfortable saddle and ergonomic handlebars support a relaxed riding position, making the Cross200 suitable for commuting, neighborhood rides, fitness cycling, and longer weekend outings.\n\nIt is designed for everyday transportation and recreation, but is not intended for technical mountain biking or aggressive off-road trails.\n\n15 inch\n5 feet 1 inch to 5 feet 5 inch\n\n17 inch\n5 feet 5 inch to 5 feet 8 inch\n\n19.5 inch\n5 feet 8 inch to 6 feet 1 inch\n\n21.5 inch\n6 feet 1 inch to 6 feet 5 inch",
